    "--json",
    "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/d9b1/lemmadeck/.intentfold/tickets/STEMROBIN-182/tmp/resume182-13/n41-n43-adapt-work/adapt/7a/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg7-c4-s2-n41/lesson.template.json"
  ],
  "cwd": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/d9b1/lemmadeck",
  "exit": 0,
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "blockIndex": 0,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "现在我们讨论各种不同的题，解这种题时，需要把含二次根式的代数式变形。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "blockIndex": 1,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "1. 化简表示式 $2.3\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{20}-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{5}}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "blockIndex": 2,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "利用从根号下面提出因数的方法可以使 $\\sqrt{20}$ 变形："
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "blockIndex": 2,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$\\sqrt{20}=\\sqrt{4\\times5}=2\\sqrt{5}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "blockIndex": 3,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "利用关于分数的平方根的定理和分数的基本性质使 $\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{5}}$ 变形："
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "blockIndex": 3,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{5}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}=\\frac{1\\times\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{5}\\times\\sqrt{5}}=\\frac{1}{5}\\sqrt{5}=0.2\\sqrt{5}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "blockIndex": 4,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "于是，"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "blockIndex": 4,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$2.3\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{20}-\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{5}}=2.3\\sqrt{5}-2\\sqrt{5}-0.2\\sqrt{5}=\\sqrt{5}(2.3-2-0.2)=0.1\\sqrt{5}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "blockIndex": 5,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "2. 约分："
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "blockIndex": 5,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{15}+2\\sqrt{5}}{3+2\\sqrt{3}}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "blockIndex": 6,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "因为 $\\sqrt{15}=\\sqrt{5}\\cdot\\sqrt{3}$，$3=(\\sqrt{3})^2$，那么"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "blockIndex": 6,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{15}+2\\sqrt{5}}{3+2\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}\\cdot\\sqrt{3}+2\\sqrt{5}}{(\\sqrt{3})^2+2\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}(\\sqrt{3}+2)}{\\sqrt{3}(\\sqrt{3}+2)}$ $=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{3}}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "把分子和分母同乘以 $\\sqrt{3}$，得："
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}\\cdot\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{3}\\cdot\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{1}{3}\\sqrt{15}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "blockIndex": 8,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "于是，"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "blockIndex": 8,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{15}+2\\sqrt{5}}{3+2\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{1}{3}\\sqrt{15}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "blockIndex": 9,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "3. 查平方根表求表示式 $\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}+4}{\\sqrt{2}-1}$ 的近似值。"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "blockIndex": 10,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "我们设法化简这个表示式。\n把这个分式的分子和分母分解因式不能化简，因此用下面的方法来作：把这个分式的分子和分母乘以这样一个式子，使得在分母里得到有理数。"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "blockIndex": 11,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "式 $\\sqrt{2}+1$ 是这种因式当中最简单的一个。"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "blockIndex": 12,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "实际上，"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "blockIndex": 12,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$(\\sqrt{2}-1)(\\sqrt{2}+1)=(\\sqrt{2})^2-1^2=2-1=1$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "blockIndex": 13,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "于是，"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "blockIndex": 13,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}+4}{\\sqrt{2}-1}=\\frac{(3\\sqrt{2}+4)(\\sqrt{2}+1)}{(\\sqrt{2}-1)(\\sqrt{2}+1)}=(3\\sqrt{2}+4)(\\sqrt{2}+1)$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "blockIndex": 14,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "作乘法计算后，得到："
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "blockIndex": 14,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$(3\\sqrt{2}+4)(\\sqrt{2}+1)=3(\\sqrt{2})^2+4\\sqrt{2}+3\\sqrt{2}+4=3\\times2+7\\sqrt{2}+4=10+7\\sqrt{2}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "blockIndex": 15,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "查表求出 $\\sqrt{2}\\approx1.414$。\n由此得："
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "blockIndex": 15,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$10+7\\sqrt{2}\\approx10+7\\times1.414=19.898$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "blockIndex": 16,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "4. 证明：对于任何 $a\\geq0$ 和 $b\\geq0$，不等式"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "blockIndex": 16,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$\\sqrt{a+b}\\leq\\sqrt{a}+\\sqrt{b}$ 成立。"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "blockIndex": 17,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "显然，对于任何 $a\\geq0$ 和 $b\\geq0$ 来说，$\\sqrt{a+b}$ 和 $\\sqrt{a}+\\sqrt{b}$ 的值是非负的。\n我们来比较它们的平方的大小："
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "blockIndex": 17,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$(\\sqrt{a+b})^2=a+b$；"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "blockIndex": 17,
      "paragraphInBlock": 2,
      "text": "$(\\sqrt{a}+\\sqrt{b})^2=(\\sqrt{a})^2+2\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}+(\\sqrt{b})^2=a+b+2\\sqrt{a}\\sqrt{b}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "blockIndex": 18,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "因为 $2\\sqrt{a}\\sqrt{b}\\geq0$，所以"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "blockIndex": 18,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$(\\sqrt{a+b})^2\\leq(\\sqrt{a}+\\sqrt{b})^2$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "blockIndex": 19,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "由此，"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "blockIndex": 19,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "$\\sqrt{a+b}\\leq\\sqrt{a}+\\sqrt{b}$。"
    }
  ],
  "resolvedBreaks": [
    8,
    16,
    27
  ],
